WEBVTT

00:05:57.788 --> 00:06:00.496
and it will feel like as strange as

00:06:00.496 --> 00:06:02.663
the world before mobile phones
feels now to us.

00:06:03.746 --> 00:06:07.871
Hmm, yeah, you mentioned your API,
I guess that stands for what,

00:06:07.913 --> 00:06:10.204
application programming interface?

00:06:10.204 --> 00:06:16.871
It's the technology that allows complex
technology to be accessible to others.

00:06:17.829 --> 00:06:22.038
So give me a sense of a couple of things
that have got you most excited that

00:06:22.038 --> 00:06:26.079
are already out there and then how
that gives you visibility to

00:06:26.079 --> 00:06:28.329
a pathway forward that is
even more exciting.

00:06:28.621 --> 00:06:32.538
So I think that the things that we're
seeing now are very much glimpse of